# REMOTE_IPV4 REMOTE_UDP_PORT LOCAL_IPV4 RELAY_UDP_PORT PUBLIC_SOURCE_UDP_PORT
#
# Each line SNATs only one local relay-to-WireGuard endpoint tuple and permits
# only its conntrack-restored replies. RELAY_UDP_PORT is the high local port
# owned by Arcway; PUBLIC_SOURCE_UDP_PORT may be 443 even when another service
# owns the unrelated public UDP listener.
203.0.113.10 51820 198.51.100.20 39443 443
